Package: mdreader
Version: 1.5.0
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, xdg-utils
Recommends: zenity
Maintainer: Sanjib Sikder
Description: Clean Markdown reader and editor (opens .md files in the browser)
 Renders Markdown with book-style typography, LaTeX maths (MathJax),
 code highlighting, tables, task lists, Mermaid diagrams and callouts.
 Works offline: all libraries and fonts are included, pages make no
 network requests. Built-in editor with live preview. Links between
 notes open in the reader. Command: mdview FILE.md
